=== Tournament Analysis: invariant mutual-explanation on all n=6 tournaments ===
vertices: ['score', 'c3', 'c4', 'c5', 'c6', 'H']
observable: U(Y|X)=1-H(Y|X)/H(Y), orient X->Y when X explains Y better
